{
  "name": "Blazing Revival",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The bond with your wildfire spirit can save you from death. If the spirit is within 120 feet of you when you are reduced to 0 hit points and thereby fall Unconscious, you can cause the spirit to drop to 0 hit points. You then regain half your hit points and immediately rise to your feet.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
